/agent402.tools/api/skill/feed-watch","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/subtitle-pipeline","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/locale-brief","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/jwt-toolkit","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/text-analyze","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/schema-guard","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/number-crunch","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/json-pipeline","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/openapi-audit","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/text-hygiene","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/loan-comparison","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/timezone-planner","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/webhook-intake","https://agent402.tools/api/skill/markdown-convert","https://agent402.tools/api/route/execute","https://agent402.tools/api/route/execute-plus","https://agent402.tools/api/route/execute-max","https://agent402.tools/api/route/execute-pro","https://agent402.tools/api/x402/seller-trust","https://agent402.tools/api/seller-dossier","https://agent402.tools/api/seller-payability"],"about":"https://github.com/MikeyPetrillo/Agent402#agent402-in-the-x402-ecosystem","name":"Agent402.Tools","summary":"Agent402.Tools - open-source, self-hostable, x402 + MPP (+ MCP server): 500+ pay-per-call tools for AI agents in one integration (the applied layer of Agentic Finance) - browser, search, PDFs, images, OCR, live financial/crypto/macro data, SEC EDGAR, 84 curated multi-tool skill packs callable as MCP prompts, wallet-keyed memory, and an OpenAI-compatible LLM gateway at /v1 (flat-priced chat from $0.003/call, embeddings $0.002 - no API key, the wallet is the account). Free via proof-of-work, or pay per call in USDC via x402 or over MPP (native Tempo, Base/Celo USDC, cards on routes of $0.50 or more).","mpp":{"enabled":true,"order":["tempo","evm","stripe"],"tempo":{"currencies":[{"address":"0x20C000000000000000000000b9537d11c60E8b50","label":"USDC.e"},{"address":"0x20c0000000000000000000000000000000000000","label":"PathUSD"}],"chainId":4217,"withheldOn":["identity-bound routes","long-running routes"]},"evm":{"rails":[{"chain":"Base","chainId":8453,"asset":"USDC","currency":"0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913"},{"chain":"Celo","chainId":42220,"asset":"USDC","currency":"0xcebA9300f2b948710d2653dD7B07f33A8B32118C"}]},"stripe":{"minUsd":0.5}},"homepage":"https://agent402.tools","repository":"https://github.com/MikeyPetrillo/Agent402","openSource":true,"selfHostable":true,"license":"AGPL-3.0-or-later","maintainer":{"name":"Havok Holdings LLC","email":"mike@agent402.tools","url":"https://github.com/MikeyPetrillo/Agent402"},"termsOfService":"https://agent402.tools/terms","privacyPolicy":"https://agent402.tools/privacy","builderCode":"bc_b4aw4uzd","baseApp":"6a3dd86ca341d86b910769fb","ecosystem":{"chains":["Base","Solana","Polygon","Arbitrum","Monad","Celo","Avalanche","Sei","Optimism","Arc","Stellar","Algorand","Robinhood Chain"],"primaryChain":"Base","primaryChainId":8453,"currency":"USDC","protocol":"x402","note":"x402 settlements use USDC on Base, Solana, Polygon, Arbitrum, Monad, Celo, Avalanche, Sei, Optimism, Arc, Stellar, Algorand; plus USDG (Global Dollar) on Robinhood Chain. Gas is sponsored by the facilitator on EVM chains - callers need only the stablecoin.","restrictedRoutes":"Identity-bound routes (the payer's signed EIP-3009 authorization is the identity) and long-running routes settle on EVM chains only; credits and Tempo are refused on the identity-bound ones. /api/pricing lists each restricted route's networks, and its 402 offers only those."},"differentiators":["Open-source and self-hostable - read every line, run it yourself (AGPL-3.0).","One integration covers all 500+ tools - no per-service SDKs or signups.","People pay too: finished reports by card at /reports ($2 to $5 by card; an agent pays the tool price per call, $0.60-$2.00 for the model-backed reports) and monitors at /monitors ($5 a month).","Two-sided: also ships agent402-tollbooth, an open pay-per-crawl gate for the demand side of x402.","Utility tools run as code with no language model writing the answer, and every route publishes a full OpenAPI schema. The /v1 gateway (metered and flat tiers), the report products and the media tools are model-backed and say so.","Free without a wallet via proof-of-work on the pure-CPU tools.","84 curated multi-tool workflows (skill packs) callable as MCP prompts - agents fetch the whole task template, not just one tool."],"twoSided":{"tollbooth":{"summary":"Open-source, self-hostable pay-per-crawl gate: charge AI crawlers per request (USDC via x402, or free proof-of-work) while humans browse free. Express middleware, reverse proxy, or edge (Cloudflare Workers / Next.js).","repository":"https://github.com/MikeyPetrillo/Agent402/tree/main/tollbooth","npm":"agent402-tollbooth"}},"payment":{"x402":{"version":2,"currency":"USDC","networks":["base","solana","polygon","arbitrum","stellar","algorand","monad","avalanche","sei","optimism","robinhood","celo","arc"],"primaryNetwork":"base","priceRange":"$0.001–$3.30","payTo":"0xaBF4FAbd7c416fB67202E5f9002389Fc75e2a9D0","payToName":"agent402.base.eth","payToByNetwork":{"evm":"0xaBF4FAbd7c416fB67202E5f9002389Fc75e2a9D0","solana":"J7aN3PLJnTCF5qpEnvJHJsnCjcGuqC2rYtEM8Gv3xwg","stellar":"GDNJXCKW7ZM7GEEVP674TWPU26YJNBQ2FI4ZIPRKTPTNUEJMDHFJWWRL","algorand":"C7IIHG7SPLPZ5H7ZT6HW3UV2OQMQQE6Y2HBNGZXSLRJULE42BEE2OY2XIE"},"payToByRoute":{"https://agent402.tools/api/route/execute":{"eip155:8453":"0x77065d81e18ad403BCD6e9A0616b288e16744121","algorand:wGHE2Pwdvd7S12BL5FaOP20EGYesN73k":"W4GZHN36X35LGSJTTLNZNFPGSSBLMJKFLCMZK4NBLQGUS6PYPPCDB67UOE"},"https://agent402.tools/api/route/execute-plus":{"eip155:8453":"0x77065d81e18ad403BCD6e9A0616b288e16744121","algorand:wGHE2Pwdvd7S12BL5FaOP20EGYesN73k":"W4GZHN36X35LGSJTTLNZNFPGSSBLMJKFLCMZK4NBLQGUS6PYPPCDB67UOE"},"https://agent402.tools/api/route/execute-max":{"eip155:8453":"0x77065d81e18ad403BCD6e9A0616b288e16744121","algorand:wGHE2Pwdvd7S12BL5FaOP20EGYesN73k":"W4GZHN36X35LGSJTTLNZNFPGSSBLMJKFLCMZK4NBLQGUS6PYPPCDB67UOE"},"https://agent402.tools/api/route/execute-pro":{"eip155:8453":"0x77065d81e18ad403BCD6e9A0616b288e16744121","algorand:wGHE2Pwdvd7S12BL5FaOP20EGYesN73k":"W4GZHN36X35LGSJTTLNZNFPGSSBLMJKFLCMZK4NBLQGUS6PYPPCDB67UOE"}},"payToNote":"The routes in payToByRoute are the router tiers: on the networks listed there they settle to the router's own spending wallet, the wallet that pays the outside sellers they buy from. Every other route and network settles to payTo / payToByNetwork.","nonCustodial":"on the x402 and MPP rails these tools never hold, receive, sign or send funds: a payment settles wallet to wallet through the facilitator. Prepaid card credits (not on sale; issued keys still spend) are the one prepaid balance, a prepayment for our own services; card reports and monitors are ordinary card charges; see /security.","builderCode":"bc_b4aw4uzd","acceptKinds":{"base":["exact","upto","exact:GatewayWalletBatched"],"polygon":["exact"],"arbitrum":["exact"],"monad":["exact"],"avalanche":["exact"],"sei":["exact"],"optimism":["exact"],"robinhood":["exact"],"celo":["exact"],"arc":["exact","exact:GatewayWalletBatched"],"solana":["exact"],"stellar":["exact"],"algorand":["exact"]},"gatewayNanopayments":{"kind":"GatewayWalletBatched","wire":"gateway-batched","networks":{"eip155:8453":{"scheme":"exact","kind":"GatewayWalletBatched","asset":"0x833589fcd6edb6e08f4c7c32d4f71b54bda02913","verifyingContract":"0x77777777dcc4d5a8b6e418fd04d8997ef11000ee","extra":{"name":"GatewayWalletBatched","version":"1","verifyingContract":"0x77777777dcc4d5a8b6e418fd04d8997ef11000ee"},"maxTimeoutSeconds":604900,"minValiditySeconds":604800},"eip155:5042":{"scheme":"exact","kind":"GatewayWalletBatched","asset":"0x3600000000000000000000000000000000000000","verifyingContract":"0x77777777dcc4d5a8b6e418fd04d8997ef11000ee","extra":{"name":"GatewayWalletBatched","version":"1","verifyingContract":"0x77777777dcc4d5a8b6e418fd04d8997ef11000ee"},"maxTimeoutSeconds":604900,"minValiditySeconds":604800}},"buyerGas":"none per payment. After a USDC deposit into Gateway (an on-chain transfer the buyer makes and pays gas for), each payment is a signature against that balance, with no gas per payment.","settlement":"batched off chain by Circle Gateway and credited to the seller's Gateway balance","note":"Offered beside the plain accept on the same networks at the same price; identity-bound routes and routes with a lasting effect keep the plain accept only. A payment whose accept carries extra.name GatewayWalletBatched is verified and settled through Circle Gateway; every other payment settles through the network's facilitator as before."}},"proofOfWork":{"summary":"No wallet? Solve a single-use sha256 puzzle (a fraction of a second of CPU) - no money, no AI tokens, no model involved.","difficultyBits":16,"eligibleTools":170,"challengeUrl":"https://agent402.tools/api/pow/challenge","info":"https://agent402.tools/api/pow"},"dataHandling":{"readsAnnotationFields":false,"retainsPaymentMetadata":false,"readsOnly":["authorization.from (signed EVM payer address, public on-chain): the identity of wallet-scoped routes and the payer recorded for a sale","the payment-identifier extension, when sent: an idempotency key bound to the credential, route and body","the payment's nonce and network: as an idempotency key for a re-sent payment, held with the cached answer for up to 10 minutes","the signers of a Solana payment transaction: to tell one paying wallet from another in failure telemetry, stored only as a keyed hash","the source of a Tempo MPP credential (a did:pkh address): to classify the payer of a sale","the payer named in the facilitator's settlement receipt: recorded with the sale when the payment itself names none we can verify"],"retains":"each sale's payer address, settlement transaction, route and price, in the sales ledger; the ledger's payer list is not published, while pages that show individual on-chain payments show them as the chain records them (shortened payer addresses), see /terms","note":"The optional x402 annotation fields description and reason are not read, logged or retained. On a refused payment the resource URL the payment names is recorded in failure telemetry.","policy":"https://agent402.tools/privacy"}},"capabilities":{"tools":625,"categories":[{"key":"web","label":"Web & documents","tools":63,"priceRange":"$0.001–$0.15","computePayable":true},{"key":"memory","label":"Agent memory & coordination","tools":11,"priceRange":"$0.001–$0.003","computePayable":false},{"key":"network","label":"Network & domains","tools":19,"priceRange":"$0.001–$0.005","computePayable":false},{"key":"data","label":"Live public data","tools":110,"priceRange":"$0.001–$0.05","computePayable":true},{"key":"payments","label":"Payments & x402","tools":20,"priceRange":"$0.001–$0.01","computePayable":true},{"key":"conversion","label":"Data conversion","tools":28,"priceRange":"$0.001–$0.002","computePayable":true},{"key":"text","label":"Text processing","tools":18,"priceRange":"$0.001–$0.002","computePayable":true},{"key":"math","label":"Math & finance","tools":8,"priceRange":"$0.001","computePayable":true},{"key":"encoding","label":"Encoding & crypto","tools":15,"priceRange":"$0.001–$0.002","computePayable":true},{"key":"identifiers","label":"Generators & IDs","tools":5,"priceRange":"$0.001","computePayable":true},{"key":"time","label":"Time & scheduling","tools":10,"priceRange":"$0.001","computePayable":true},{"key":"validation","label":"Validation & parsing","tools":20,"priceRange":"$0.001–$0.004","computePayable":true},{"key":"llm","label":"LLM gateway","tools":51,"priceRange":"$0.001–$2.00","computePayable":false},{"key":"crypto","label":"Crypto & onchain data","tools":111,"priceRange":"$0.001–$0.01","computePayable":true},{"key":"chain","label":"Sanctions & address screening","tools":2,"priceRange":"$0.002–$0.005","computePayable":false},{"key":"wallet","label":"Wallet operations","tools":5,"priceRange":"$0.001–$0.02","computePayable":fals